      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "王玄載，字彥休，下邳人也。",
      "reading": "傳首明彥休、下邳。",
      "note": "傳首明彥休、下邳。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 13,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence1-13",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "祖宰，偽北地太守。",
      "reading": "祖宰任北地，「偽」為書中用語。",
      "note": "祖宰任北地，「偽」為書中用語。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 13,
      "end_codepoint": 22,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence1-22",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "父蕤，東莞太守。",
      "reading": "父蕤任東莞。",
      "note": "父蕤任東莞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 22,
      "end_codepoint": 30,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "玄載解褐江夏王國侍郎、太宰行參軍。",
      "reading": "起家江夏王國侍郎及太宰行參軍。",
      "note": "起家江夏王國侍郎及太宰行參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 17,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-17",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "泰始初，為長水校尉。",
      "reading": "宋泰始初任長水。",
      "note": "宋泰始初任長水。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 17,
      "end_codepoint": 27,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-27",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "隨張永征彭城，臺軍大敗，玄載全軍據下邳城拒虜，假冠軍將軍。",
      "reading": "隨張永征彭城後據下邳，假冠軍。",
      "note": "隨張永征彭城後據下邳，假冠軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 27,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-56",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "官軍新敗，人情恐駭，以玄載士望，板為徐州刺史、持節、監徐州豫州梁郡軍事、寧朔將軍、平胡中郎將，尋又領山陽、東海二郡太守。",
      "reading": "板除徐州軍政、山陽東海等郡。",
      "note": "板除徐州軍政、山陽東海等郡。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 56,
      "end_codepoint": 116,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-116",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "五年，督青、兖二州刺史，將軍、東海郡如故。",
      "reading": "承宋泰始，五年469。",
      "note": "承宋泰始，五年469。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 116,
      "end_codepoint": 137,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-137",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "七年，復為徐州，督徐兖二州、鍾離太守，將軍、郎將如故。",
      "reading": "七年471，復徐州並鍾離。",
      "note": "七年471，復徐州並鍾離。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 137,
      "end_codepoint": 164,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-164",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "遷左軍將軍。",
      "reading": "遷左軍。",
      "note": "遷左軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 164,
      "end_codepoint": 170,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-170",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "仍為寧朔將軍、歷陽太守，改持節、都督二豫、冠軍將軍、南豫州刺史，太守如故。",
      "reading": "轉歷陽、南豫及諸職。",
      "note": "轉歷陽、南豫及諸職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 170,
      "end_codepoint": 207,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-207",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "遷撫軍司馬。",
      "reading": "遷撫軍司馬。",
      "note": "遷撫軍司馬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 207,
      "end_codepoint": 213,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-213",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "出為持節、督梁南北秦三州軍事、冠軍將軍、西戎校尉、梁秦二州刺史。",
      "reading": "出監梁秦。",
      "note": "出監梁秦。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 213,
      "end_codepoint": 245,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-245",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "進號征虜將軍。",
      "reading": "進號征虜。",
      "note": "進號征虜。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 245,
      "end_codepoint": 252,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence2-252",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "尋徙督益寧二州、益州刺史、建寧太守，將軍、持節如故。",
      "reading": "徙益寧、建寧。",
      "note": "徙益寧、建寧。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 252,
      "end_codepoint": 278,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "沈攸之之難，玄載起義送誠，進號后軍將軍，封鄂縣子。",
      "reading": "沈攸之舉事，玄載送誠，封鄂縣子。",
      "note": "沈攸之舉事，玄載送誠，封鄂縣子。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 25,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence3-25",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "征散騎常侍，領后軍，未拜，建元元年，為左民尚書，鄂縣子如故。",
      "reading": "徵散騎、領后軍尚未拜。建元元年479為左民，南史作左戸。",
      "note": "徵散騎、領后軍尚未拜。建元元年479為左民，南史作左戸。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 25,
      "end_codepoint": 55,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:received_sentence3-55",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "會虜動，南兖州刺史王敬則奔京師，上遣玄載領廣陵，加平北將軍、假節、行南兖州事，本官如故。",
      "reading": "王敬則奔還，高帝遣玄載領廣陵，行南兖州。",
      "note": "王敬則奔還，高帝遣玄載領廣陵，行南兖州。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 55,
      "end_codepoint": 99,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
