      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "事寧，為光祿大夫、員外散騎常侍。",
      "reading": "事寧，為光祿、員外散騎。",
      "note": "事寧，為光祿、員外散騎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p003",
