      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "85g_yq3_0w6_AA",
      "source_quote": "永明四年，為持節監兖州緣淮諸軍事、平北將軍、兖州刺史。",
      "reading": "永明四年486兖州；武帝紀同。",
      "note": "永明四年486兖州；武帝紀同。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 115,
